[{"id":"CN-TR-004","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","状态"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>TCP 标志位和状态机应如何配合解释？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>标志位描述当前报文的控制意图，状态描述本端连接上下文；相同标志在不同状态可能触发不同转换。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>例如 SYN 把主动端带到 SYN-SENT，收到 SYN-ACK 后回 ACK 并进入 ESTABLISHED；FIN 表示一个方向结束，RST 表示立即重置，不能只按“有包/没包”解释。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-locator-role","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["Locator","语义定位"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(三)页面元素定位.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(三)页面元素定位","articlePath":"posts/d5972197/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(三)页面元素定位.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(三)页面元素定位","articlePath":"posts/d5972197/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么优先使用 \u003ccode>get_by_role()\u003c/code>？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它按用户可感知的角色和名称定位元素。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>角色定位更接近真实交互合同，能降低 DOM 重构带来的影响，也能暴露缺少名称或错误角色等语义问题。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]